OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry through the day with
OL,6,Fsome sunny spells, perhaps the odd
OL,7,Flight shower across Down. Western
OL,8,Fcounties will cloud over towards
OL,9,Fevening with perhaps a little rain in
OL,10,Fthe far west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe east will be dry with
OL,13,Fsome clear spells this evening. Cloud
OL,14,Fand rain will spread to western areas,
OL,15,Fturning heavier and then extending to
OL,16,Fthe east overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
