OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA cloudy start with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, but soon
OL,7,Fbrightening up in the west with sunny
OL,8,Fintervals and the odd shower, these
OL,9,Fbrighter conditions reaching the east
OL,10,Fin the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FThursday bright with sunny spells and
OL,14,Fthe odd shower. Heavy rain on Thursday
OL,15,Fnight clearing during Friday, windy.
OL,16,FBright with some showers on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
